12  Can two gloves be used with the PGSI at the same time?

The PGSI was designed to accept two PowerGloves at the same time.  The code
for two-glove support has not yet been written, and in truth, may never be
completed.  It is our hope that the use of two gloves will be supported at some time,
but at present there is no one working on it.

Note: Two PGSI single-glove units will not work together, since the devices
are not synchronized and the glove units will interfere.

