 15 How can I pay for a PGSI?

ACM is a non-profit organization, not a company.  This limits the ways
in which we can accept payment.  We prefer a personal or coroporate check,
or money order, though purchase orders are acceptable if you get them
approved by us first.

 16 Can a PGSI be shipped overseas?

Yes.  We will ship overseas, but additional shipping fees apply.

 17 How long will I have to wait for my PGSI?

We currently have about 50 PGSI's available.  These units are available
for immediate shipment.  We are, however, not a company.  Our members do
not get paid in any way for their time with our organization.   This means
that we are often a little bit slow with shipping, especially around finals
and exam times (We're all students).  In the US, you should have your
PGSI about 2 weeks after you oder it, unless we get busy.

